# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile. The build context is the repo root
# (`docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .`), so apps/api/.dockerignore is NOT consulted — without this
# file the host's node_modules, dist and data directories are shipped into the context and COPYed over
# the image's pnpm-installed workspace.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/data
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
docs
infra
scripts
.github
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
